WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie face down, forehead on the mat, legs extended.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend both knees and reach back to hold the tops of the feet or ankles.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Press the feet toward the floor beside the hips, elbows lifting.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Lift the chest gently, keeping the pubic bone grounded.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Release the feet one at a time and rest on the belly.
